msgstr "為什麼我收到「No such file or directory」？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:490
#: 7906f8fe1cdd4a28b3fa8531569f4d82
msgid ""
"Your working directory does not contain the required files. Go back and "
"follow the instructions more carefully, making sure that you put all "
"required files in the same directory *and* navigate to that directory."
msgstr ""
"您的工作目錄不包含所需的檔案。返回並更仔細地遵循說明，確保將所有所需檔案放在"
"同一個目錄中\\ *並*\\ 導航到該目錄。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:493
#: 6f79dfb4b0c14c349a887fa16ebc0dde
msgid ""
"Why am I getting \"can't open signed data ‘Qubes-RX-x86_64.iso'\" / \"no "
"signed data\" / \"can't hash datafile: No data\"?"
msgstr ""
"為什麼我收到「can't open signed data 'Qubes-RX-x86_64.iso'」/「no signed "
"data」/「can't hash datafile: No data」？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:496
#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:558
#: 60c24abcbf014c8ab2587b9a7b0d2ed0 38aad842410e4f719c0206d343347d3c
msgid "The correct ISO is not in your working directory."
msgstr "正確的 ISO 不在您的工作目錄中。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:499
