msgid ""
"Why am I getting \"can't open ‘Qubes-RX-x86_64.iso.asc' / verify signatures "
"failed: file open error\"?"
msgstr ""
"為什麼我收到「can't open 'Qubes-RX-x86_64.iso.asc' / verify signatures "
"failed: file open error」？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:502
#: 9dc6477842594030897218ba1353f435
msgid ""
"The correct :ref:`detached PGP signature file <project-security/verifying-"
"signatures:how to verify detached pgp signatures on qubes isos>` is not in "
"your working directory."
msgstr ""
"正確的 :ref:`分離式 PGP 簽章檔案 <project-security/verifying-signatures:how "
"to verify detached pgp signatures on qubes isos>` 不在您的工作目錄中。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:505
#: 4a9ef63505de4339a818166b9781ebad
msgid "Why am I getting \"no valid OpenPGP data found\"?"
msgstr "為什麼我收到「no valid OpenPGP data found」？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:508
#: ba13ea4207c04d8cba6a60ba189389c1
msgid ""
"Either you don’t have the correct :ref:`detached PGP signature file <project-"
"security/verifying-signatures:how to verify detached pgp signatures on qubes "
"isos>`, or you inverted the arguments to ``gpg2``. (The signature file goes "
"first.)"
msgstr ""
"您沒有正確的 :ref:`分離式 PGP 簽章檔案 <project-security/verifying-"
"signatures:how to verify detached pgp signatures on qubes isos>`，或者您將 "
"``gpg2`` 的引數順序顛倒了。（簽章檔案在前。）"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:511
#: ec42724bf35044bc8da6cc0d1a4708b7
msgid ""
"Why am I getting \"WARNING: This key is not certified with a trusted "
"signature! There is no indication that the signature belongs to the owner.\"?"
msgstr ""
"為什麼我收到「WARNING: This key is not certified with a trusted signature! "
"There is no indication that the signature belongs to the owner.」？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:514
#: 8daad65952df4bd1b3eb1fd89de749a8
msgid "There are several possibilities:"
msgstr "有幾種可能性："

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:516
#: a9effdb84c914eeaadb59efa008fd80b
msgid ""
"You don’t have the :ref:`Qubes Master Signing Key <how-to-import-QMSK>`."
msgstr "您沒有 :ref:`Qubes Master Signing Key <how-to-import-QMSK>`。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:518
#: 5192c7daf2964984ae04516dcf3ab634
msgid ""
"You have not :ref:`set the Qubes Master Signing Key’s trust level correctly. "
"<how-to-import-QMSK>`"
msgstr ""
"您尚未\\ :ref:`正確設定 Qubes Master Signing Key 的信任等級。 <how-to-import-"
"QMSK>`"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:520
#: 38b3f03cd9c24ec3a18c64e6e75c4af1
msgid ""
"In the case of a key that is not directly signed by the Qubes Master Signing "
"Key, you have not :ref:`set that key’s trust level correctly. <project-"
"security/verifying-signatures:how to verify signatures on git repository "
"tags and commits>`"
msgstr ""
"對於非由 Qubes Master Signing Key 直接簽署的金鑰，您尚未 :ref:`正確設定該金鑰"
"的信任等級。 <project-security/verifying-signatures:how to verify signatures "
"on git repository tags and commits>`"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:525
#: 623cc3e38ed9411f95a3f3922f11363c
msgid "Why am I getting \"X signature not checked due to a missing key\"?"
msgstr "為什麼我收到「X signature not checked due to a missing key」？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:528
#: 96639b66748145efa2518b168000b6b1
msgid ""
"You don’t have the keys that created those signatures in your keyring. For "
"the purpose of verifying a Qubes ISO, you don’t need them as long as you "
"have the :ref:`Qubes Master Signing Key <how-to-import-QMSK>` and the :ref:"
"`release signing key <how-to-import-RSK>` for your Qubes release."
msgstr ""
"您的金鑰環中沒有建立這些簽章的金鑰。就驗證 Qubes ISO 而言，只要您擁有 :ref:"
"`Qubes Master Signing Key <how-to-import-QMSK>` 和您 Qubes 版本的\\ :ref:`發"
"佈簽署金鑰 <how-to-import-RSK>`\\ ，就不需要它們。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:531
#: 54f04daec765498d94733290a36295a7
msgid ""
"Why am I seeing additional signatures on a key with \"[User ID not found]\" "
"or from a revoked key?"
msgstr ""
"為什麼我在金鑰上看到帶有「[User ID not found]」或來自已撤銷金鑰的額外簽章？"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:534
#: ee74fcc7daab42f08ba7b9e5826dd806
msgid ""
"This is just a fundamental part of how OpenPGP works. Anyone can sign anyone "
"else’s public key and upload the signed public key to keyservers. Everyone "
"is also free to revoke their own keys at any time (assuming they possess or "
"can create a revocation certificate). This has no impact on verifying Qubes "
"ISOs, code, or keys."
msgstr ""
"這只是 OpenPGP 運作方式的基本部分。任何人都可以簽署他人的公鑰並將簽署後的金鑰"
"上傳到 keyserver。每個人也可以隨時自由撤銷自己的金鑰（假設他們擁有或可以建立"
"撤銷憑證）。這不影響驗證 Qubes ISO、程式碼或金鑰。"

#: ../../../project-security/verifying-signatures.rst:537
#: f8c81b08f0484b4288cc448abf39a6df
msgid "Why am I getting \"verify signatures failed: unexpected data\"?"
msgstr "為什麼我收到「verify signatures failed: unexpected data」？"

